232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (Dataset Dependency and Size Constraints: While the model performs well on the Kaggle dataset, this data originates from European cardholders over two days in September 2013. Its ability to generalize across different geographic regions, time periods, and fraud patterns remains a limitation until validated against continuously updated, multi-regional transaction datasets. Class Imbalance Vulnerabilities: The dataset exhibits extreme class imbalance \(only 0.17% fraud\). Although addressed using undersampling and SMOTE, undersampling discards valuable legitimate transaction data while synthetic samples may not perfectly represent real future fraud behaviors. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
