237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The primary application of this system is to act as a real-time fraud scoring engine integrated into banking authorization pipelines. When a transaction is initiated, the model scores it within milliseconds, enabling banks to automatically flag or block high-probability fraud before processing, dramatically reducing financial losses. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 123 0 R
/T (12.2 Automated Transaction Triage )
/E (12.2 Automated Transaction Triage )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (In high-volume transaction environments, manual fraud review is impossible at scale. This model can be integrated as an automated triage tool. Transactions flagged as fraudulent with high confidence are held for analyst review, while low-risk transactions flow through instantly, optimizing both security and customer experience. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
240 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 123 0 R
/T (12.4 Training Tool for Fraud Analysts )
/E (12.4 Training Tool for Fraud Analysts )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (Because this system utilizes feature importance mapping \(clearly defining which transaction characteristics like V14 and V4, V4 and V12, and V17 drive fraud detection\), it serves as an excellent training tool for fraud analysts and compliance teams. Junior investigators can use the system to study how different transaction patterns correlate with fraud, developing stronger intuition for anomaly detection. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 123 0 R
/T (12.3 Fraud Analytics Dashboard )
/E (12.3 Fraud Analytics Dashboard )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (Access to advanced fraud detection systems is often limited to large banks with significant IT budgets. By deploying this lightweight ML model as a cloud-based API or microservice, smaller financial institutions, credit unions, and fintech startups can access enterprise-grade fraud protection without building expensive in-house ML infrastructure. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
