247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (The current architecture uses PCA-transformed static features. A significant future enhancement would be integrating deep learning models such as LSTMs or Autoencoders to directly process raw transaction sequences. By modeling temporal spending behavior and merchant category patterns, a sequence-aware model could detect novel fraud schemes that evade pattern-based detection. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
