/P 124 0 R
/E (Currently, the model is tuned for credit card fraud detection. Future iterations will aim to build a generalized financial fraud framework. By incorporating behavioral data, geolocation, and merchant patterns, detection capabilities can be extended to wire transfer fraud, e-commerce fraud, and identity theft scenarios. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
