/P 124 0 R
/E (To transition this project into a production-ready banking tool, the next step involves cloud deployment. By hosting the model on platforms like AWS or Google Cloud and wrapping it in a secure RESTful API, financial institutions can connect their payment processing systems directly to the prediction engine for real-time fraud scoring on every transaction. )
/Pg 26 0 R
